Description What one tab of the bottom panel is showing.
Examples: EnumerationValues
| Value        | Notes                                             |
| ImportReview | An import waiting to be looked over and accepted  |
| FindResults  | The transactions a find matched                   |

Attributes BottomPanelTabRow
