Description An import is shown in a tab of the bottom panel rather than in a
Description dialog of its own, so that the register it is about to change stays
Description in view while it is read. Nothing reaches the book until it is
Description accepted.

Attributes ImportReviewRow
Description One row of an import waiting to be reviewed. Account is where the
Description money moved; Category is the other side as the import worked it out.
