# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Find
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

Description Find looks across transactions for ones matching what was typed,
Description and shows the matches in a tab of the bottom panel, beside the
Description register, the same as an import. There is one Find dialog, so
Description performing a find again replaces that tab's results rather than
Description opening a second one.
Details A blank field in FindCriteria is not a filter: Text blank matches
Details every payee and memo, a blank date or amount bound is open-ended, and
Details a blank Account matches every account. AmountFrom and AmountTo bound
Details the amount's absolute value, so a search for 80.00 to 100.00 finds
Details both a payment of -89.99 and a deposit of 89.99 -- a person recalling
Details a transaction rarely remembers which side of it they are thinking of.
Details Account matches a category the same way a real account's, and
Details matches a transaction if either side of it is the named account or
Details anything beneath it.
Details
Details FindResultRow names the transaction the way a register names the
Details other side of a transfer: Account is the side the result is read
Details under, and Category is the other side of it. Scoped to one register,
Details that is always the register searched. Scoped to every register, a
Details transaction that matches on both sides of a transfer is a row under
Details each, because there is no one register it belongs to more than the
Details other.

$WIP
DataType FindScope
Description Which registers a find looks through.
Examples: EnumerationValues
| Value          | Notes                                    |
| CurrentRegister | Only the register open in the active tab |
| AllRegisters   | Every account in the book                 |

Attributes FindCriteria
| Attribute  | Type        | Default         |
| Text       | Text        | none            |
| DateFrom   | Text        | none            |
| DateTo     | Text        | none            |
| AmountFrom | Money       | none            |
| AmountTo   | Money       | none            |
| Account    | AccountPath | none            |
| Scope      | FindScope   | CurrentRegister |

Attributes FindResultRow
| Attribute | Type           | Default    |
| Ref       | TransactionRef |            |
| Date      | Date           | 2024-01-01 |
| Payee     | PayeeName      | none       |
| Account   | AccountPath    |            |
| Category  | Text           | none       |
| Amount    | Money          | 0.00       |

