When account selected : AccountSelect
| Path            |
| Assets:Checking |
When register lines selected : RegisterSelect
| Line |
| 1    |
Then menu items are : MenuItem
| Item              | Enabled |
| Recategorize...   | true    |
| Add payee rule... | true    |
| Delete...         | true    |

